title: "AEON: Adaptive Economically-Optimized Network for AI Inference Orchestration"
abstract: "An adaptive compute orchestration layer that dynamically routes inference across available models, deterministic tools, multi-level memory, reasoning strategies, execution depth, precision, and hardware accelerators."
